 {
  "en": "Square Root is a modified Quadratic that can be exited to gain Root Essence (commonly abbreviated as RE).<br>\n        While in Square Root, your points are raised ^0.5 (hence the name \"Square Root\"). You gain RE based on how far you get.<br>\n        However, Root Essence is not farmable. Your Root Essence gained in a Square Root run is based on your X and Y, minus your<br>\n        current Root Essence, so you have to get farther to gain more.<br><br>\n        <b>Base RE Gain Formula:</b> (1.1<sup>(x/100)-1</sup> * 1.25<sup>y</sup>) - current RE<br><br>\n        Root Essence can be used to purchase Square Root Upgrades, along with a Root Essence doubler, which works like the x<sup>2</sup><br>\n        Doubler. Its starting cost is 200, multiplying by 5 per purchase, and starts scaling faster at 100 purchases.\n        ${player.totalPoints.gte(\"1e5e8\") || player.integrations.gte(1) ?",
  "kind": "exact",
  "contexts": [
   "js-other"
  ],
  "sources": [
   "textbook.js"
  ]
 },
